# Operator working files: raw carrier captures + drafted manifests live under
# backend/imports/*/captures/ and are NOT committed. The reviewed dataset
# (backend/fixtures/**, incl. test .html/.mhtml/.json) and the manifest
# templates ARE committed and are what a fresh deploy bootstraps from.
backend/imports/*/captures/*
!backend/imports/*/captures/.gitkeep

